---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="The Experience — SolScape Retreats" description="Movement is for every body. Discover SolScape's approach to yoga, barre, and breathwork — and why it works so well in a retreat setting.">

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: Hero
       ============================================================ -->
  <div class="detail-hero" style="min-height: 60vh;">
    <div class="hero-bg" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562088287-bde35a1ea917?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80');"></div>
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="sub">The Practice</p>
      <h1>Movement is for<br><em>every body</em></h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: Philosophy
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="exp-philosophy">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="philosophy-grid">
        <!-- TODO: Replace with your photo URL -->
        <div class="philosophy-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126613408-eca07ce68773?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80');"></div>
        <div class="philosophy-text">
          <p class="section-label">Our Philosophy</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">Structure that creates <em>space</em></h2>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <p>A SolScape retreat isn't a holiday with a yoga class attached. It's a programme — intentional and structured — designed to give the body and mind enough challenge that real rest becomes possible afterward. You move properly. You breathe properly. You eat well. You sleep deeply. And by day three, something starts to shift.</p>
          <p>We believe that movement and stillness are not opposites — they're partners. A strong barre session in the morning makes the meditation in the evening land differently. The breathwork circle clears whatever the afternoon excursion stirred up. The structure is what creates the space.</p>
          <p>No experience is required. No specific body type. No performance. What we ask is that you show up willing to try, and we take care of the rest.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: Offerings
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="offerings-section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">What We Offer</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Three pillars of <em>practice</em></h2>
      <div class="offerings-grid">

        <div class="offering-card">
          <svg class="offering-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="#CC9A67" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round">
            <circle cx="24" cy="14" r="8"/>
            <path d="M12 42 Q24 30 36 42"/>
            <line x1="24" y1="22" x2="24" y2="34"/>
            <line x1="17" y1="31" x2="24" y2="34"/>
            <line x1="31" y1="31" x2="24" y2="34"/>
          </svg>
          <h3>Yoga</h3>
          <p>Samantha leads morning yoga sessions designed to work with every level of practice. She moves through vinyasa sequences that build heat and focus, before settling into longer holds that allow the nervous system to downregulate. Sessions end with a short guided savasana. Every class is adapted in real time to the group.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--terra);">Led by Samantha · All levels</p>
        </div>

        <div class="offering-card">
          <svg class="offering-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="#CC9A67" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M12 36 Q16 14 24 12 Q32 14 36 36"/>
            <line x1="18" y1="22" x2="30" y2="22"/>
            <path d="M16 40 L32 40"/>
          </svg>
          <h3>Barre</h3>
          <p>Nada's barre sessions are precise, progressive, and genuinely hard — in the best possible way. Expect small, targeted movements that challenge muscle groups you've forgotten you have, followed by long stretches that make you grateful for every second of effort. No equipment needed. No ballet background required.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--terra);">Led by Nada · All levels</p>
        </div>

        <div class="offering-card">
          <svg class="offering-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="#CC9A67" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M24 38 L24 18"/>
            <path d="M24 18 Q18 12 12 14"/>
            <path d="M24 22 Q30 16 36 18"/>
            <path d="M24 28 Q17 24 14 26"/>
            <path d="M24 32 Q31 28 34 30"/>
            <path d="M10 40 Q24 36 38 40"/>
          </svg>
          <h3>Movement in Nature</h3>
          <p>Outdoor movement sessions designed to reconnect the body with its natural environment — walks, flows, and practices held in the open air. Each session is adapted to the landscape and the group, and often becomes the experience people carry home longest.</p>
          <p style="margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--terra);">Guided · All levels</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: Founder Quote — Samantha
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="founder-quote" style="padding-bottom: 50px;">
    <blockquote>
      "What I've learned from years of teaching is that the body already knows what it needs. Our job isn't to push it harder — it's to create the conditions where it can finally ask for what it wants, and then give it time to receive it."
      <cite>— Samantha, Co-Founder &amp; Yoga Teacher</cite>
    </blockquote>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: Founder Quote — Nada
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="founder-quote" style="padding-top: 50px;">
    <blockquote>
      "Barre isn't about being a dancer — it's about discovering what precision and consistency feel like in your own body. When you do that in a beautiful place, surrounded by people who showed up for themselves, something shifts."
      <cite>— Nada, Co-Founder &amp; Barre Instructor</cite>
    </blockquote>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: SolScape Circle (Evening Practice)
       ============================================================ -->
  <section style="background: var(--cream); padding: 100px 40px;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="philosophy-grid">
        <div class="philosophy-text">
          <p class="section-label">Evening Practice</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">SolScape <em>Circle</em></h2>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <p>Each evening ends with the SolScape Circle — a dedicated space for ritual, reflection, and release. Depending on the retreat, evenings may include trance movement, guided personal psychology sessions, yoga philosophy discussions, or simply sitting together in intentional silence.</p>
          <p>These are the moments that turn a programme into a transformation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-img" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515377905703-c4788e51af15?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80');"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: Past Retreats
       ============================================================ -->
  <section style="background: var(--white); padding: 100px 40px;">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Where We've Been</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Retreats that <em>shaped us</em></h2>
      <div class="divider" style="margin-bottom: 48px;"></div>
      <div class="retreat-cards">

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-banner" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1539768942893-daf53e448371?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80');">
            <div class="card-location">
              <small>North Africa</small>
              Egypt
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="card-dates">Past Retreat</p>
            <p class="card-desc">Our desert retreat. Dunes, palm groves, and a silence so complete it recalibrates the nervous system. Practice at dawn before the heat arrives, and stargazing until sleep comes easily.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-banner" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1570077188670-e3a8d69ac5ff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80');">
            <div class="card-location">
              <small>Aegean Islands</small>
              Greece
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="card-dates">Past Retreat</p>
            <p class="card-desc">Whitewashed light and Aegean air. Practice sessions on the rooftop at golden hour, evenings in the SolScape Circle listening to the island breathe.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-banner" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1752253509873-86363f0188b0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80');">
            <div class="card-location">
              <small>Central Italy</small>
              Tuscany
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="card-dates">Past Retreat</p>
            <p class="card-desc">Rolling hills, olive groves, and vineyard light. Morning barre on the terrace as the mist cleared. One of the most quietly beautiful settings we've taken the practice into.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-banner" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504019347908-b45f9b0b8dd5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80');">
            <div class="card-location">
              <small>Catalonia</small>
              Spain
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="card-dates">Past Retreat</p>
            <p class="card-desc">Coast, culture, and heat. Morning practice on terracotta terraces and afternoons in a landscape that lives equally well in sun and shade.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: Your Hosts
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="hosts-section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Your Hosts</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Meet <em>Nada &amp; Samantha</em></h2>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div class="hosts-grid">
        <div class="host-card">
          <img src={`${base}/images/team/nada-hosts.png`} alt="Nada — Barre Instructor &amp; Co-Founder">
          <div style="padding: 24px 28px;">
            <p style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--terra);">Barre Instructor &amp; Co-Founder</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="host-card">
          <img src={`${base}/images/team/samantha-hosts.png`} alt="Samantha — Yoga Teacher &amp; Co-Founder">
          <div style="padding: 24px 28px;">
            <p style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--terra);">Yoga Teacher &amp; Co-Founder</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: CTA Band
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="cta-band">
    <h2>Ready to <em>experience it</em><br>for yourself?</h2>
    <p>Join us in Greece this October, or explore all our upcoming destinations.</p>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:16px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a href={`${base}/retreats/greece`} class="btn btn-primary">View Greece 2026</a>
      <a href={`${base}/#retreats`} class="btn btn-outline">All Retreats</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
